": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1DPjlQQk1ToQ7kNvwFpKAj0&_nc_oc=AdrY55spN9CW3fVqj0DsumLoK1wA8k1EE_r_-mfxrnowprMx27LHZ_KkS4d9jqTVW7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIQS1WO5X7tvXVGOd4GA5L3PBM-XjqRSv_QYSqbCOWjw&oe=6AF09E1B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cl3hbKHtQ2UQ7kNvwE2n34w&_nc_oc=AdphJaOFu3dl08OWla26jXrQS4YhBMDSnp2gNVef--iX-tsEKGFclppFL2eLLDcSa0I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRahrESAugiQKaP6qJPwyTdfYKIP3BSxVeAR0gwWflQMg&oe=6AF08E61"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EZE39_SkB2IQ7kNvwFR38by&_nc_oc=AdqTHwO2j4z895xiOijy1_38drhsDR7YdvWw4dda9bkW3hATb9BrU8gOvfoV3JuXRm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9g4JwUuBpoeyF5vPHWR3cboBDnAPaYThyaQ2GLZFBhw&oe=6AF0B36F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XD7b4n82w1YQ7kNvwGTZ7tu&_nc_oc=Adrm2ybYfr45n8FrMda6ghvIYrZTRHV8TsXjtXd1KdCycEGp5B3YYU8Kf_eSuwujFz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRdBhjqxodXt1aUzHiMFD4-YsfoGjyoJG9y7HrCF1b-3Q&oe=6AF0B312"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RMOys9aCiQ4Q7kNvwH5Sy68&_nc_oc=AdrFuiQYkrY2Fce7Y-oC3jZkADoLs9wCpxvHlCPAT0b6jSSohHcxi6vaC9XFa2J1DdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnwGLn0-og5dZbYF0kVkGTt63gUlv7D34BOnoxDtqUXQ&oe=6AF0847D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a